{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國科技集團CrowdStrike已同意以約440億美元的價格收購雲安全公司Zscaler。這筆交易預計將締造一家網絡安全巨頭。此次全股票收購正值全球企業和政府面臨新一輪技術系統故障之際。近幾周，包括微軟和美國聯邦航空管理局（FAA）在內的多個機構的在線系統因技術故障而癱瘓。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587634.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:03:50.893819+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:48:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:57:10.447429+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:57:10.447429+00:00","content_hash":"1a422668b1176420e7832108c58a4a026a549d13e2dc1890d4bc29965c81aa9d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}